---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Secure checkout readiness | USD Impact"
  description="Lemon Squeezy is selected as Merchant of Record while USD Impact public checkout remains safely disabled pending final release approval."
>
  <main class="account-main">
    <section class="account-panel" aria-labelledby="checkout-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">USD IMPACT CHECKOUT</p>
      <h1 id="checkout-title">Checkout is not open yet.</h1>
      <p>
        Lemon Squeezy is the selected Merchant of Record for the one-time Library Pass. The secure account,
        purchase-intent, verified-webhook, and entitlement foundation has been verified in Test Mode. Public payment
        remains disabled until the remaining buyer disclosures, operational checks, final release review, and explicit
        approval for Live activation are complete.
      </p>
      <dl class="account-details" aria-label="Commerce readiness">
        <div>
          <dt>Commerce foundation</dt>
          <dd id="commerce-state">Checking…</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Buyer disclosures</dt>
          <dd id="seller-disclosure-state">Required before Live</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Public checkout</dt>
          <dd id="checkout-state">Disabled</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
      <p id="commerce-message" class="account-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">
        No payment can be made on this page. A browser redirect alone never grants access.
      </p>
      <div class="button-row account-actions">
        <a class="button primary" href="/book/read-the-dollar-first/#book-waitlist">Join the launch waitlist</a>
        <a class="button account-secondary" href="/account/">Return to your account</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="account-panel" aria-labelledby="buyer-disclosure-gate-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">PRE-CHECKOUT RELEASE GATE</p>
      <h2 id="buyer-disclosure-gate-title">Before any payment can open</h2>
      <p>
        Live checkout is blocked until the customer-facing seller and Merchant-of-Record information has been
        verified, approved, and made available before payment. Missing or partial disclosure data cannot enable checkout.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>verified legal operator and geographic trader address;</li>
        <li>applicable tax / VAT status wording;</li>
        <li>selected Merchant of Record, buyer terms, and provider privacy terms;</li>
        <li>checkout tax and supported-currency wording;</li>
        <li>refund and payment-support responsibility allocation; and</li>
        <li>explicit final approval of the complete buyer-facing disclosure set.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Approved seller disclosure: <strong>USD Impact</strong> is operated by <strong>SC Kela Leads SRL</strong>,
        a company registered in Romania under CUI <strong>40790448</strong> and Trade Register number
        <strong>J38/820/2020</strong>. Registered business address:
        <strong>Str. Doctor Hacman nr. 28, bl. 83, sc. B, ap. 9, 240232 Râmnicu Vâlcea, România</strong>.
        Support: <a href="mailto:support@usd-impact.com">support@usd-impact.com</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        The one-time <em>Read the Dollar First Library Pass</em> is sold through <strong>Lemon Squeezy</strong>,
        whose current legal operator is <strong>Link, LLC f/k/a Lemon Squeezy LLC</strong>, acting as Merchant of
        Record and authorized reseller. Lemon Squeezy provides the hosted checkout, processes payment, and issues
        the applicable payment receipt or invoice. Its
        <a href="https://www.lemonsqueezy.com/buyer-terms" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buyer Terms</a> and
        <a href="https://www.lemonsqueezy.com/privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Policy</a> apply to the
        payment transaction.
      </p>
      <p>
        SC Kela Leads SRL is the product supplier. No separate Romanian VAT-registration status is asserted in this
        disclosure. Applicable indirect taxes are calculated, collected and remitted by Lemon Squeezy as Merchant
        of Record and shown before payment. The final amount and currency are displayed by Lemon Squeezy before
        payment is confirmed.
      </p>
      <p>
        USD Impact owns product, account, and access support and reviews refund requests under its
        <a href="/refund-policy/">14-day Refund Policy</a>. Lemon Squeezy processes approved payment refunds and
        handles payment-specific transaction support, disputes, and chargebacks.
      </p>
      <p>
        This exact public-facing disclosure bundle is approved for later commerce activation. Production
        configuration, public payment, and Live checkout remain disabled pending their separate release gates.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="seller-disclosure-panel" class="account-panel" aria-labelledby="seller-disclosure-title" hidden>
      <p class="eyebrow">BUYER INFORMATION</p>
      <h2 id="seller-disclosure-title">Seller and payment-provider disclosure</h2>
      <dl class="account-details">
        <div><dt>Brand</dt><dd id="seller-brand"></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Legal operator</dt><dd id="seller-legal-name"></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Registration</dt><dd id="seller-registration"></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Jurisdiction</dt><dd id="seller-jurisdiction"></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Geographic address</dt><dd id="seller-address"></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Tax / VAT status</dt><dd id="seller-tax-status"></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Merchant of Record</dt><dd id="seller-mor"></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Checkout tax / currency</dt><dd id="seller-checkout-tax"></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Refund / payment support</dt><dd id="seller-refund-support"></dd></div>
        <div><dt>USD Impact support</dt><dd id="seller-support-email"></dd></div>
      </dl>
      <p>
        <a id="seller-buyer-terms" href="#" rel="noopener noreferrer">Merchant-of-Record buyer terms</a>
        ·
        <a id="seller-provider-privacy" href="#" rel="noopener noreferrer">Payment-provider privacy terms</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    const stateElement = document.getElementById('commerce-state');
    const checkoutElement = document.getElementById('checkout-state');
    const messageElement = document.getElementById('commerce-message');
    const disclosureStateElement = document.getElementById('seller-disclosure-state');
    const disclosurePanel = document.getElementById('seller-disclosure-panel');

    const stateLabels = {
      ready_for_provider_configuration: 'Ready for provider configuration',
      ready_for_sandbox: 'Ready for sandbox verification',
      ready_for_controlled_live_test: 'Ready for a controlled Live test',
      active: 'Active',
      blocked: 'Blocked',
    };

    const setText = (id, value) => {
      const element = document.getElementById(id);
      if (element) element.textContent = typeof value === 'string' ? value : '';
    };

    const setHttpsHref = (id, value) => {
      const element = document.getElementById(id);
      if (!(element instanceof HTMLAnchorElement) || typeof value !== 'string') return false;
      try {
        const url = new URL(value);
        if (url.protocol !== 'https:' || url.username || url.password) return false;
        element.href = url.toString();
        return true;
      } catch {
        return false;
      }
    };

    const renderSellerDisclosure = (commerce) => {
      const disclosure = commerce?.sellerDisclosure;
      if (!commerce?.disclosuresComplete || !disclosure || typeof disclosure !== 'object') {
        if (disclosureStateElement) disclosureStateElement.textContent = 'Required before Live';
        if (disclosurePanel instanceof HTMLElement) disclosurePanel.hidden = true;
        return;
      }

      if (!setHttpsHref('seller-buyer-terms', disclosure.buyerTermsUrl)
        || !setHttpsHref('seller-provider-privacy', disclosure.providerPrivacyUrl)) {
        if (disclosureStateElement) disclosureStateElement.textContent = 'Verification unavailable';
        if (disclosurePanel instanceof HTMLElement) disclosurePanel.hidden = true;
        return;
      }

      setText('seller-brand', disclosure.brand);
      setText('seller-legal-name', disclosure.legalName);
      setText('seller-registration', disclosure.registration);
      setText('seller-jurisdiction', disclosure.jurisdiction);
      setText('seller-address', disclosure.geographicAddress);
      setText('seller-tax-status', disclosure.taxStatus);
      setText('seller-mor', disclosure.merchantOfRecord);
      setText('seller-checkout-tax', disclosure.checkoutTaxDisclosure);
      setText('seller-refund-support', disclosure.refundSupportDisclosure);
      setText('seller-support-email', disclosure.supportEmail);
      if (disclosureStateElement) disclosureStateElement.textContent = 'Complete and approved';
      if (disclosurePanel instanceof HTMLElement) disclosurePanel.hidden = false;
    };

    fetch('/api/commerce-readiness', {
      method: 'GET',
      credentials: 'same-origin',
      cache: 'no-store',
      headers: { Accept: 'application/json' },
    })
      .then(async (response) => {
        const body = await response.json().catch(() => ({}));
        if (!response.ok || !body.commerce) throw new Error('Commerce readiness could not be verified.');
        const commerce = body.commerce;
        if (stateElement) stateElement.textContent = stateLabels[commerce.state] || 'Unavailable';
        if (checkoutElement) checkoutElement.textContent = commerce.checkoutEnabled ? 'Enabled' : 'Disabled';
        renderSellerDisclosure(commerce);
        if (messageElement) {
          messageElement.textContent = commerce.message || 'Public checkout remains disabled.';
          messageElement.dataset.state = commerce.state === 'blocked' ? 'error' : 'success';
        }
      })
      .catch((error) => {
        if (stateElement) stateElement.textContent = 'Verification unavailable';
        if (checkoutElement) checkoutElement.textContent = 'Disabled';
        if (disclosureStateElement) disclosureStateElement.textContent = 'Verification unavailable';
        if (disclosurePanel instanceof HTMLElement) disclosurePanel.hidden = true;
        if (messageElement) {
          messageElement.textContent = error instanceof Error
            ? `${error.message} Public checkout remains disabled.`
            : 'Commerce readiness could not be verified. Public checkout remains disabled.';
          messageElement.dataset.state = 'error';
        }
      });
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
